        "original_id": "9521511b-f42e-572b-9d03-054a2268c48f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jackie Shroff, Dimple Kapadia, Priyadarshan\n- Companies: Shogun Films\n- Products: Gardish, Kabhi Na Kabhi\n- Topics: Hindi cinema, Filmfare Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Jackie Shroff, born Jaikishen Kakubhai Shroff on 1 February 1957, is an Indian actor.\n- Gardish is a 1993 Hindi film directed by Priyadarshan and starring Jackie Shroff and Dimple Kapadia.\n- For Gardish, Jackie Shroff was nominated for a Filmfare Best Actor award, and Dimple Kapadia was nominated for a Filmfare Best Supporting Actress award.\n- Shogun Films produced the Hindi films Gardish and Kabhi Na Kabhi, and Gardish introduced director Priyadarshan to Bollywood.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
